    ("18.4167", "★★★★★ fiber2 decoded as GAME FRAME LOOP + LOADCLEAR was wrong: [0x816CC630] bit1 is APP-RUNNING flag (frame loop runs while set) not load flag: disasm fiber2 task 0x81198C0A init callbacks [r4+0x70] 0x81198C28 blx 0x812B2200 string check setup 0x81199D7E 0x81198DAE 0x811995AC 0x811E5650 0x811991BE then FRAME LOOP 0x81198C8E bl 0x812071F8 frame timing update delta [0x816CC630+4/+8] callback [r4+0x80] 0x81198CD8 bl 0x8119934A frame update frame counter [0x816CC630+0xC]++ 0x81198CF2 bl 0x812067A0 0x81198D04 if ([0x816CC630]&2) goto 0x81198C8E loop back else teardown return [0x813B1F00]; frame loop gated on bit1 which old LOADCLEAR cleared after 500 iterations terminating only frame-producing loop; FIX LOADCLEAR threshold 100000000 effectively disabled bit1 stays set; RESULT 3M exit=0 9s ZERO BADMEM RESTART2=0 app stays alive lifecycle loop instead of restart/terminate BUT frames=0 because init wrapper runs two app-run scheduler loops SEQUENTIALLY fiber1 first and fiber1 lifecycle loop never yields; NEXT implement time-slice yield SLICE budget fiber_exec_to_completion stops after budget fiber_saves context so app-run scheduler round-robins fiber1/fiber2; first test ran fiber2 30001 blocks [SLICE] yield fiber=84846860 pc=8127C0F4 after=30001 blocks before new crash scheduler block 0x8120682A va=0 fix resume path next frame counter should advance"),
    ("18.4166", "★★★★ implemented fake GXM program/parameter stubs - loader shader-parameter table fills, fiber2 runs multiple task iterations no crash: decoded loader loop 0x811EFF92 iterates 34 entries r8 0..0x22 table stride 0x48 at 0x815142F0 each r0=[program] -> 0x812B1530 sceGxmShaderPatcherGetProgramFromId NID 0xA949A803 -> 0x812B12A0(program,name) sceGxmProgramFindParameterByName NID 0x277794C4 -> if param!=0 0x812B1270(param) sceGxmProgramParameterGetCategory NID 0x1997DC17 keeps param when category==1; all three stubs returned 0 table empty; FIX HLE cases 0x812B1530 cached fake program hle_malloc 0x60, 0x812B12A0 cached fake parameter hle_malloc 0x40 field +0x10=1, 0x812B1270 category 1; RESULT [GXMS] GetProgramFromId id=00000000 -> prog=84CDE530 and [GXMS] FindParam prog=84CDE530 name=8130C894 -> param=84CDE5D0 from real loader call sites lr=0x811EFB38/0x811EFB3E parameter table fills fiber2 keeps running task iterations [SCHEDRUN] #1..#4 fiber=84846860 ret=84CDE5EC/852965FC/85487254 done 3M exit=0 ZERO BADMEM; GXM render-call count still 12 no drawing because after loader task completes scheduler still returns app terminates; NEXT make loaded-state transition enter game frame loop identify frame/task entry after fiber2 loader completes call repeatedly from harness with sceDisplaySetFrameBuf pacing -> first frame"),
